  instructionText: 'OCCUPATIONAL HEALTH AND SAFETY


    Before touching any equipment:
    wear your anti-static wrist strap, check that power cables are secure and walkways
    are clear, and make sure the workstation is properly ventilated.


    Read the
    job order. You are setting up SERVER01 as the domain controller for the cssncii.local
    lab network, then verifying it from CLIENT01.


    Tap NEXT when you are ready
    to begin.'
